      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Observer ->  Its aim is that whenever main state\nchanges, the observer gets called and is updated.\n\n\nMediator -> It focuses on making 2 (or more)\ncolleagues on interacting with each other.\nUsecases is like when making chess.com where 2 or\nmore players are interacting with each other.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Observer ->  Its aim is that whenever main state changes, the observer gets called and is updated.\n\n\nMediator -> It focuses on making 2 (or more) colleagues on interacting with each other.\nUsecases is like when making chess.com where 2 or more players are interacting with each other.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
